      "text": "Display things to the user\n\nAllow you to leverage systems created by other people instead of writing from scratch\n\nThings they have:\n- State management systems\n- Integrating JS with HTML/CSS\n- Rendering engine\n- Component Libraries\n- Component Tree Structure",
